#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:19
msgid "Player Settings"
msgstr "播放器设置"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:32
msgid "Global Player"
msgstr "全局播放器"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:37
msgid "Show Global Player"
msgstr "显示全局播放器"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:40
msgid "Shows a player bar at the bottom of every front-end page. With a theme that uses swup, playback continues across pages."
msgstr "在每个前台页面底部显示播放条。如果主题使用了 swup，切换页面时播放不会中断。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:45
msgid "Before Anything Is Played"
msgstr "尚未播放时"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:49
msgid "Show the player with an episode loaded (paused)"
msgstr "显示播放器并预载一集（暂停状态）"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:50
msgid "Hide the player until a play button is used"
msgstr "隐藏播放器，直到点击播放按钮"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:53
msgid "For visitors without a saved position. The loaded episode is the one being viewed on an episode page, otherwise the latest. \"Hide\" needs play buttons on the page, which the theme has to provide."
msgstr "适用于没有保存播放进度的访客。在单集页面预载当前单集，其他页面预载最新一集。“隐藏”需要页面上有播放按钮，这需要由主题提供。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:58
msgid "Player Style"
msgstr "播放器样式"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:63
msgid "The look of the player bar and its full-screen \"Now Playing\" panel. Ignored when the theme styles the player itself."
msgstr "播放条及其全屏“正在播放”面板的外观。主题自行定义播放器样式时，此项不生效。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:82
msgid "Player Width"
msgstr "播放器宽度"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:86
msgid "Match the theme's wide width"
msgstr "与主题的宽版宽度一致"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:87
msgid "Match the theme's content width"
msgstr "与主题的内容宽度一致"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:88
msgid "The style's own width"
msgstr "使用样式自身的宽度"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:89
msgid "Full width"
msgstr "全宽"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:92
msgid "Theme widths are measured from the theme's WordPress layout (block themes and themes with theme.json), so the bar lines up with the header, footer or post content. Themes without it keep the style's own width."
msgstr "主题宽度根据主题的 WordPress 布局（区块主题及带 theme.json 的主题）测得，使播放条与页眉、页脚或文章内容对齐。没有此布局的主题使用样式自身的宽度。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:97
msgid "Player Bar Background"
msgstr "播放条背景"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:101
msgid "Translucent (frosted glass)"
msgstr "半透明（磨砂玻璃）"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:102
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "不透明"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:105
msgid "Translucent lets the page show through the bar, blurred. The Aurora style is always frosted."
msgstr "半透明会让页面内容模糊地透过播放条显示。极光样式始终为磨砂效果。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:110
msgid "Player Colors"
msgstr "播放器配色"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:114
msgid "Follow the site theme (auto detect)"
msgstr "跟随网站主题（自动识别）"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:115
msgid "Follow the visitor's system setting"
msgstr "跟随访客的系统设置"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:116
msgid "Always light"
msgstr "始终浅色"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:117
msgid "Always dark"
msgstr "始终深色"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:120
msgid "Every style has a light and a dark variant. Auto detect reads the light / dark markers and the background color of the current theme, and follows its toggle. Ignored when the theme styles the player itself."
msgstr "每种样式都有浅色和深色两个版本。自动识别会读取当前主题的浅色 / 深色标记和背景色，并跟随主题的切换。主题自行定义播放器样式时，此项不生效。"

#: app/Settings/PlayerSetting.php:124
